{#
  Who reacted to one post or reply, and with what — the content of the
  dialog a reaction tally's own click opens (public/assets/js/groups.js).
  `groups` is Service\ReactorListService's own return shape: entries
  already in the fixed display order, one per reaction key that actually
  has a reactor.

  A moderator sees this on a hidden item too (Controller\ReactionController
  own reactors() actions decide that, same as the rest of a hidden item's
  content) — nothing here needs to know the item is hidden at all.
#}
{% if groups is empty %}
    <p class="text-body-secondary mb-0">Personne n'a encore réagi.</p>
{% else %}
    <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0 groups-reactors-list">
        {% for group in groups %}
            <li class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2 mb-2">
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="fs-5 lh-1">{{ group.emoji }}</span>
                <span>{{ group.names|join(', ') }}</span>
            </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
{% endif %}
